WEBVTT

00:20.667 --> 00:22.337
Huh?

00:32.577 --> 00:33.297
Huh?!

00:33.727 --> 00:34.967
What's this?

00:38.567 --> 00:40.807
It won't end like this!

00:39.267 --> 00:40.227
Floor one!

00:41.147 --> 00:43.197
I'm sorry, mother.

00:41.687 --> 00:43.197
Floor two!

00:44.037 --> 00:45.447
Floor three!

00:46.317 --> 00:47.487
And then...

00:47.487 --> 00:48.447
Floor four!

00:49.597 --> 00:52.827
There are two ways battles 
in this fleeting world end.

00:52.827 --> 00:55.537
One is light, the other is dark.

00:55.537 --> 00:58.767
I'm impressed you defeated the 
previous Mercross Deathly Kings...

00:58.767 --> 01:01.707
and made it this far!

01:07.367 --> 01:09.917
We didn't even break a sweat.

01:09.917 --> 01:11.467
We don't have time to waste.

01:11.467 --> 01:13.357
He's upstairs, right?

01:14.347 --> 01:17.137
I can see why you made it this far.

01:17.137 --> 01:17.947
However!

01:18.287 --> 01:20.857
If you truly want to meet him,

01:21.257 --> 01:24.987
you'll have to defeat me, 
Shine Girard, first!

01:25.217 --> 01:27.767
So, which one of you is first?

01:33.387 --> 01:35.077
That'll be me!

01:36.167 --> 01:38.157
Nice muscles!

01:42.047 --> 01:45.967
Um... This is the place, right?

01:51.837 --> 01:53.757
Does that mean I should just go in?

01:55.177 --> 01:56.837
Pardon me.

02:14.807 --> 02:17.947
You made it, Amelia Rose.

02:17.947 --> 02:21.537
It's nice to meet you, um...

02:21.937 --> 02:23.917
I am Lieselotte Eden.

02:23.917 --> 02:27.537
Maybe you'll understand if I 
say "Sorcerer of Fabrication?"

02:27.537 --> 02:28.887
Um...

02:28.887 --> 02:30.417
Fabri...cation?

02:31.397 --> 02:32.547
What?!

03:00.327 --> 03:02.667
Good morning, Master Julius.

03:02.667 --> 03:04.817
Good morning, Emma.

03:04.817 --> 03:05.957
Please take these.

03:08.967 --> 03:12.347
<i>Why does he always chew them up?</i>

03:15.467 --> 03:19.427
<b>The Iceblade <b>Sorcerer
</b>Shall <b>Rule </b>the <b>World</b></b>

03:19.857 --> 03:23.987
<b>Episode 02
The Boy Who Is the
World's Strongest Sorcerer Dons a Mask</b>

03:25.577 --> 03:27.717
I'm honored to meet you.

03:27.987 --> 03:30.377
My name is Ariane Algren.

03:30.377 --> 03:32.237
It's a pleasure.

03:32.237 --> 03:34.067
I'm Sasha White.

03:34.067 --> 03:35.517
I'm Luther.

03:35.517 --> 03:36.847
They're my parents.

03:36.847 --> 03:39.117
That's my mom and dad!

03:40.457 --> 03:42.837
It's very cramped, but we 
hope you'll enjoy your stay.

03:42.837 --> 03:43.727
Not at all!

03:43.727 --> 03:47.377
I should be apologizing for 
intruding so unexpectedly.

03:47.377 --> 03:48.367
Ariane.

03:48.367 --> 03:49.117
Yes?

03:49.417 --> 03:52.377
Our training will start tomorrow morning.

03:52.377 --> 03:54.857
You can take Stella's 
bed while we stay here.

03:55.387 --> 03:57.007
But then where will she sleep?

03:57.007 --> 04:00.017
I sleep with my big brother, 
so you're fine.

04:00.017 --> 04:00.827
Huh?

04:00.827 --> 04:02.587
She always does that.

04:02.587 --> 04:05.397
She... wha—?

04:05.397 --> 04:07.237
Oh, that Stella.

04:07.237 --> 04:09.147
She really loves her big brother.

04:09.147 --> 04:11.067
We take our baths together, too!

04:11.067 --> 04:12.067
Yeah.

04:12.067 --> 04:13.667
You two just get along so well.

04:14.397 --> 04:16.397
Now, wait one second!

04:17.257 --> 04:18.777
What's wrong, Ariane?

04:19.277 --> 04:23.127
Everyone line up over there!

04:23.127 --> 04:25.817
There... there... there...

04:26.857 --> 04:28.207
Jeez.

04:28.207 --> 04:29.537
Um...

04:29.867 --> 04:33.277
We have been thinking that this 
might become a problem soon.

04:33.277 --> 04:34.147
Right?

04:34.147 --> 04:35.337
Right...

04:35.337 --> 04:36.857
This is not good!

04:39.057 --> 04:41.627
Being close as siblings is one thing,

04:41.627 --> 04:44.807
but what will you do if she can't 
get married because of that?!

04:45.747 --> 04:47.667
Then I'm going to marry my big brother!

04:47.667 --> 04:49.787
That's not what I mean!

04:51.677 --> 04:52.647
Big Brother.

04:52.647 --> 04:53.687
Y-Yes?

04:53.687 --> 04:55.487
Even if we have to be apart,

04:55.487 --> 04:57.687
our relationship won't change!

04:57.687 --> 05:00.107
Yeah! That's right!

05:00.447 --> 05:01.827
You two.

05:01.827 --> 05:03.707
They grow up so fast...

05:03.707 --> 05:04.797
Big Brother.

05:04.797 --> 05:05.477
Stella.

05:05.477 --> 05:06.267
Big Brother.

05:06.267 --> 05:06.957
Stella.

05:06.957 --> 05:07.787
Big Brother.

05:07.787 --> 05:08.617
Stella.

05:08.617 --> 05:10.137
How should I put this...

05:10.957 --> 05:13.107
You can tell they're siblings.

05:13.107 --> 05:13.967
Yeah!

05:13.107 --> 05:13.967
Right!

05:15.767 --> 05:19.687
Um, so Ray told me to...

05:19.687 --> 05:22.977
Yes, he told me to take care of you.

05:23.187 --> 05:24.977
I owe him one.

05:24.977 --> 05:25.877
Owe?

05:25.877 --> 05:29.657
But with that said, I have 
an interest in you as well.

05:29.657 --> 05:31.217
Amelia Rose.

05:31.217 --> 05:32.177
Huh?

05:32.177 --> 05:33.837
The Butterfly Effect.

05:35.027 --> 05:36.747
Your original spell.

05:37.097 --> 05:40.107
The magic that interferes 
with all causalities.

05:40.997 --> 05:42.867
I trembled!

05:42.867 --> 05:44.917
You did?

05:44.917 --> 05:50.247
However, magic that is too powerful 
sometimes ends up killing its user.

05:50.517 --> 05:51.747
Which is exactly why...

05:55.827 --> 05:59.887
I figured that I have to provide 
you with proper guidance.

05:59.887 --> 06:00.897
Okay...

06:03.877 --> 06:05.797
Got you!

06:08.827 --> 06:10.147
Well done...

06:10.147 --> 06:11.507
Go ahead then.

06:11.817 --> 06:14.617
He is one floor higher...

06:16.837 --> 06:18.337
Nicely done!

06:19.207 --> 06:20.527
All right!

06:20.527 --> 06:21.717
Let's go.

06:21.717 --> 06:24.517
Yeah, finally.

06:33.097 --> 06:34.287
Excuse us!

06:34.907 --> 06:38.537
We'd like to talk, Lucas Forst.

06:40.457 --> 06:41.787
You two are?

06:41.787 --> 06:43.087
Ray White.

06:44.047 --> 06:47.197
We want to go up against 
him in a full-on battle!

06:47.197 --> 06:48.797
You do too, right?

06:49.297 --> 06:51.517
As the Peerless Blade Sorcerer...

06:51.517 --> 06:53.757
I want to fight against the Iceblade.

06:54.227 --> 06:59.957
I wanted you to see that the strongest 
sorcerer is the Peerless Blade.

06:59.957 --> 07:01.467
<i>Peerless Blade?!</i>

07:02.077 --> 07:04.157
Is that why you're here?

07:04.157 --> 07:05.027
Yes.

07:05.027 --> 07:07.567
You're the only one we 
want to team up with!

07:07.567 --> 07:09.007
I see.

07:09.007 --> 07:11.597
I won't use my sword.

07:11.597 --> 07:13.087
You can come at me together.

07:13.527 --> 07:17.457
I want to see your power... 
and your resolve.

07:17.777 --> 07:20.757
Also, never wear shoes on tatami mats.

07:22.157 --> 07:24.577
Ready when you are.

07:35.547 --> 07:39.667
She must have been so happy that 
her big brother came home.

07:39.667 --> 07:43.567
Ray and Stella really get along so well.

07:43.567 --> 07:44.547
Don't they?

07:44.547 --> 07:46.567
Almost as if they're actually siblings.

07:46.977 --> 07:51.157
But in the beginning, 
both of them kept their distance.

07:51.157 --> 07:52.927
What? Really?

07:52.927 --> 07:53.757
Yes.

07:54.237 --> 07:58.997
Lydia, my younger sister, 
asked me to take Ray in.

07:58.997 --> 08:01.357
Thinking about it, so much has happened.

08:02.947 --> 08:04.227
Are you interested?

08:05.467 --> 08:07.767
In what Ray was like
when he first came here?

08:07.767 --> 08:09.337
Y-Yes please.

08:10.517 --> 08:13.797
Ariane, so about tomorrow's training...

08:15.257 --> 08:16.327
What's wrong?

08:16.327 --> 08:19.267
Oh, it's nothing!

08:19.267 --> 08:20.427
Really?

08:21.027 --> 08:22.237
Stella!

08:22.817 --> 08:26.437
You look too adorable asleep, 
but you shouldn't be sleeping here.

08:26.437 --> 08:28.177
You need to sleep in your bed!

08:29.787 --> 08:32.027
We'll continue tomorrow. 'Kay?

08:32.027 --> 08:33.577
Yes!

08:33.577 --> 08:34.827
Right, Ariane.

08:34.827 --> 08:36.287
Yes!

08:36.727 --> 08:38.877
We're starting early tomorrow, at six.

08:39.277 --> 08:41.047
You should go to bed soon too.

08:41.587 --> 08:43.247
You're right.

08:45.077 --> 08:48.087
Good night then, ma'am.

08:48.087 --> 08:50.187
Good night.

08:55.307 --> 08:57.937
It can still run!

09:01.807 --> 09:02.827
Got it.

09:06.047 --> 09:09.307
Damn! We couldn't even 
land a single hit...

09:09.307 --> 09:12.077
So this is one of the 
seven grand sorcerers...

09:12.077 --> 09:15.697
It's impressive you've lasted this long.

09:15.697 --> 09:18.657
It's an honor to receive such praise.

09:18.657 --> 09:22.547
Next time, we're going to at 
least make you move one step...

09:28.047 --> 09:30.447
You two are fun.

09:32.457 --> 09:36.497
Albert Allium and Evi Armstrong, is it?

09:37.327 --> 09:40.097
I'm looking forward to this, Ray White.

09:44.517 --> 09:46.257
It looks like he will participate.

09:46.257 --> 09:47.077
You know who.

09:47.077 --> 09:48.877
Oh, the Iceblade.

09:48.877 --> 09:51.027
And it seems the Peerless Blade 
will enter as well.

09:51.027 --> 09:53.557
That's interesting.

09:53.557 --> 09:57.707
Even the previous Peerless Blade 
was obsessed with the Iceblade.

09:57.977 --> 10:02.277
Helena Grady, the Grim Reaper, 
and Paratrogo.

10:02.647 --> 10:05.207
The Iceblade has defeated 
each one of them.

10:05.397 --> 10:08.137
It's unmistakable; he is continually 
regaining his powers.

10:08.137 --> 10:13.357
Then it seems like his overheating 
wasn't just overheating.

10:14.107 --> 10:14.957
Yes.

10:14.957 --> 10:18.467
We've made numerous 
test subjects overheat,

10:18.757 --> 10:22.357
but all we can tell so far is that 
the Iceblade's case is special.

10:22.357 --> 10:25.847
If that's so, it must be Akasha.

10:27.217 --> 10:29.387
What is Ray doing?

10:29.387 --> 10:32.727
He said he'd start setting up first.

10:32.727 --> 10:34.787
Oh my, is that so?

10:34.787 --> 10:35.737
That's right.

10:35.737 --> 10:38.217
So let's go to the Dogma Forest together!

10:38.837 --> 10:40.637
And go!

10:42.457 --> 10:44.087
Please wait!

10:44.087 --> 10:46.187
Zoom!

10:44.667 --> 10:46.747
Stella?!

10:47.637 --> 10:51.037
Ariane, this way!

10:52.517 --> 10:53.837
Hey!

10:53.837 --> 10:56.567
That was quite the distance.

10:58.007 --> 11:00.497
So this is the Dogma Forest?

11:00.497 --> 11:01.227
Yup.

11:01.227 --> 11:03.517
You'll be training here every day
from now on.

11:03.517 --> 11:04.877
I see...

11:04.877 --> 11:06.287
Good morning, Ariane!

11:07.357 --> 11:08.367
Ray...

11:08.367 --> 11:10.167
Oh, that's...

11:11.687 --> 11:13.117
That's...

11:13.117 --> 11:14.037
What is?

11:15.307 --> 11:16.567
Oh, that!

11:25.977 --> 11:28.517
Ray... is that you?

11:28.957 --> 11:31.917
My name is Master White!

11:32.497 --> 11:34.227
Black!

11:34.227 --> 11:37.197
Black... Black... Black...

11:37.197 --> 11:39.677
From this day forth, 
I shall be your instructor.

11:39.677 --> 11:40.437
I'm sorry?

11:40.437 --> 11:44.567
Master White... Black?

11:44.567 --> 11:47.607
Are you white or black?

11:48.077 --> 11:49.697
Trainee Ariane.

11:49.697 --> 11:50.917
Yes?

11:50.917 --> 11:52.637
It seems you have completely forgotten,

11:52.637 --> 11:53.977
but you reply with "ranger."

11:53.977 --> 11:54.807
What?

11:54.807 --> 11:57.597
I said, you reply with "ranger!"

11:57.597 --> 12:00.567
Ranger, I say!

12:00.567 --> 12:03.677
Today, the Ainsworth-style 
boot camp starts.

12:03.677 --> 12:05.567
We will begin the training with

12:05.567 --> 12:07.827
"A Chapter in Survival Training" 
and real battles!

12:08.107 --> 12:09.687
Prepare yourself!

12:12.017 --> 12:13.407
Immediately.

12:13.407 --> 12:15.847
R-Ranger! I say!

12:16.337 --> 12:18.207
We do not need the "R" and 
we do not need the "I say"!

12:18.477 --> 12:20.757
Anger!

12:20.757 --> 12:22.017
Keep one "R."

12:22.567 --> 12:24.977
R-Ranger!

12:24.977 --> 12:28.027
ger... ger...

12:28.027 --> 12:28.737
Good!

12:28.737 --> 12:31.237
With that, we will begin your 
battle training immediately.

12:31.237 --> 12:32.347
Ranger!

12:32.347 --> 12:34.357
Why don't I introduce my helper?

12:34.357 --> 12:35.617
Helper?

12:35.617 --> 12:38.217
Good morning, Trainee Ariane.

12:38.217 --> 12:39.747
Stella?

12:46.277 --> 12:50.097
My name is Sister White Gray!

12:50.097 --> 12:51.837
I'll come at you with all I've got!

12:53.107 --> 12:54.287
<i>Gray?</i>

12:54.287 --> 12:56.437
<i>So not white and not black?</i>

12:56.437 --> 12:58.367
Wait a moment...

12:58.367 --> 13:00.097
What's the matter, Trainee Ariane?

13:00.097 --> 13:03.127
The Dogma Forest is S-tier difficulty!

13:03.127 --> 13:04.227
What of it?

13:04.227 --> 13:06.377
What of it... What?

13:06.977 --> 13:08.267
It's fine.

13:08.267 --> 13:10.947
When it comes to close-quarters combat,

13:10.947 --> 13:13.497
her abilities are equivalent to mine.

13:13.937 --> 13:16.697
The monsters in this forest 
are nothing to worry about.

13:18.357 --> 13:20.787
It's fine, Trainee Ariane.

13:23.357 --> 13:24.917
All right then.

13:25.277 --> 13:27.527
There's so much I want to say,

13:27.527 --> 13:29.497
but I'll just trust you with this!

13:43.837 --> 13:46.457
It's a Huge Scorpion!

13:46.947 --> 13:48.507
You got this, Gray?

13:48.507 --> 13:49.877
Of course, Big Br—

13:49.877 --> 13:50.867
Black!

13:52.317 --> 13:54.167
What? Just a...

14:05.597 --> 14:07.417
All right! Done.

14:07.417 --> 14:08.867
Um, Ray?

14:08.867 --> 14:10.837
I am Master White Black.

14:10.837 --> 14:12.557
Well then, Master Black.

14:12.557 --> 14:13.787
What is it?

14:14.107 --> 14:16.747
What did Stel—I mean, Gray—just do?

14:16.747 --> 14:17.977
She just kicked it.

14:17.977 --> 14:18.917
What about magic?

14:18.917 --> 14:20.207
Only body enhancement.

14:20.547 --> 14:23.157
One hit? With just a body enhancement?

14:23.157 --> 14:27.987
Stel—I mean, Gray's—specialty is 
finding a creature's weak points.

14:27.987 --> 14:31.487
And if we were to talk about physical 
prowess without magical enhancements,

14:31.487 --> 14:33.647
it's not too far-fetched to say 
that she's better than me.

14:34.067 --> 14:37.287
She's a martial arts specialist.

14:38.867 --> 14:40.457
Ariane!

14:40.817 --> 14:42.297
I'm strong, huh?

14:42.297 --> 14:43.497
Y-Yes.

14:43.497 --> 14:47.067
You can tell you were trained 
by Ra— I mean, Master Black.

14:47.277 --> 14:49.827
Master Black and Lydia!

14:49.827 --> 14:53.727
The previous and current Iceblade.

14:53.727 --> 14:56.087
Quite the elite education.

14:57.637 --> 14:59.117
Right.

14:59.117 --> 15:02.097
Now we will begin the battle 
training in earnest!

15:02.097 --> 15:03.097
What do you say?

15:03.097 --> 15:04.517
Ranger!

15:05.417 --> 15:08.607
Is this where we'll be training?

15:08.607 --> 15:09.457
Yes.

15:09.457 --> 15:12.077
But if we're using magic, 
the furniture could get...

15:12.077 --> 15:13.837
Don't worry about it.

15:19.977 --> 15:20.867
This is...

15:21.907 --> 15:25.097
A space covered in 
fabrication... I suppose.

15:25.387 --> 15:27.967
Severed from the causalities 
of the outside world,

15:27.967 --> 15:29.877
so you don't have to 
worry about anything.

15:30.187 --> 15:33.077
<i>So this is something one of the 
seven grand sorcerers can do?</i>

15:33.077 --> 15:36.087
Let's talk about the 
plan for your training.

15:37.207 --> 15:39.317
You could say that

15:39.317 --> 15:42.247
your Butterfly Effect spell 
supersedes my magic.

15:42.247 --> 15:44.367
Well, I wouldn't go so far—

15:43.497 --> 15:47.387
It's true that I still have 
more experience as a sorcerer.

15:47.797 --> 15:52.167
But if you look at the nature of the 
Butterfly Effect, it's clear as day.

15:52.167 --> 15:53.137
What do you mean?

15:53.137 --> 15:55.767
Of all the causalities out in the world,

15:55.767 --> 15:58.037
I am only able to intervene 
in a small part.

15:58.037 --> 16:01.147
However, you are able to 
intervene in all of them.

16:01.377 --> 16:04.147
You definitely have what it takes to 
become one of the seven grand sorcerors.

16:04.147 --> 16:05.397
Me?

16:05.637 --> 16:09.287
You might have difficulty believing 
that right now, but it is the truth.

16:09.287 --> 16:10.167
Besides...

16:10.657 --> 16:12.927
The seven grand sorcerors go around.

16:13.917 --> 16:16.657
Now, shall we begin, Amelia Rose?

16:16.657 --> 16:18.167
Yes!

16:18.667 --> 16:21.667
Stella is really impressive.

16:21.667 --> 16:23.907
I was no match for her.

16:23.907 --> 16:27.257
This is the first time you've 
fought in the forest, right?

16:27.667 --> 16:31.337
Stella is very used to fighting 
in this environment,

16:31.337 --> 16:32.687
so that is a big handicap.

16:32.687 --> 16:36.157
I was still very appalled 
by my own shortcomings.

16:36.157 --> 16:37.907
That's why we train.

16:37.907 --> 16:40.127
Yes. I'll do my best.

16:40.957 --> 16:44.557
I am completely convinced 
that you can do it, Ariane.

16:46.927 --> 16:48.557
What is it?

16:50.077 --> 16:52.177
Nothing. I felt someone looking at us.

16:52.177 --> 16:53.277
Looking?

16:53.277 --> 16:55.937
R-Roar!

16:57.027 --> 16:59.197
Oh, it's just a tiger.

16:59.197 --> 17:00.637
Wha? Huh?!

17:00.637 --> 17:02.987
If it's a wild tiger, 
we've got nothing to fear.

17:02.987 --> 17:05.007
But that was a...

17:07.407 --> 17:10.467
I can't believe you picked 
a large feline beast!

17:10.467 --> 17:12.717
It's fortunate that we weren't discovered!

17:12.717 --> 17:16.167
I mean, they don't exactly 
have house cats around here.

17:16.167 --> 17:20.117
Anyway, what did you think?

17:20.117 --> 17:21.227
What do you mean?

17:21.227 --> 17:23.477
The distance. Weren't they too close?

17:23.477 --> 17:27.857
Well, Ray's always like 
that with everyone—

17:27.197 --> 17:29.427
I don't mean Ray!
I'm talking about Ariane!

17:30.527 --> 17:33.547
I guess she doesn't hate him.

17:33.547 --> 17:36.537
It appears as though their relationship 
is growing ever closer.

17:36.537 --> 17:42.517
So... Why are we here, wearing these, 
and doing whatever <i>this</i> is?

17:42.877 --> 17:45.967
How did you even find 
out Ray's home address?

17:45.967 --> 17:48.497
I got it via
the student council's authority.

17:49.217 --> 17:51.017
This is for Rebecca.

17:51.017 --> 17:52.717
Is this really okay?!

17:52.717 --> 17:54.357
It's for Rebecca!

17:55.847 --> 17:57.267
Can I go home now?

17:57.267 --> 17:58.767
No!

17:58.767 --> 18:01.567
I'm not comfortable here on my own!

18:01.567 --> 18:03.057
Then let's go home.

18:03.057 --> 18:04.267
We can't!

18:04.717 --> 18:09.207
We're the only ones who'll give proper
consideration to Rebecca's feelings.

18:24.687 --> 18:28.047
From today on, we're going to 
practice real guerrilla warfare!

18:28.447 --> 18:30.547
We'll properly analyze various 
environments and situations,

18:30.547 --> 18:33.797
and learn ways of fighting
while always having the advantage!

18:34.097 --> 18:35.297
Beat that into your body!

18:39.737 --> 18:40.487
Ah!

18:40.487 --> 18:42.037
I say!

18:42.037 --> 18:42.977
Ranger!

18:43.317 --> 18:45.317
Then let's go.

18:45.317 --> 18:48.147
Yeah! Our training starts now!

18:52.657 --> 18:53.847
That's right.

18:53.847 --> 18:58.577
Feel the flow of all the prima 
materia surrounding your body.

19:17.817 --> 19:19.597
Ouch.

19:21.297 --> 19:22.857
Lieselotte.

19:23.397 --> 19:25.227
Thank you so much.

19:25.597 --> 19:26.847
It's nothing.

19:26.847 --> 19:29.367
Maybe this is how I should have done it.

19:30.457 --> 19:32.107
Lieselotte?

19:32.847 --> 19:34.037
I'm fine.

19:34.377 --> 19:36.107
Shall we continue?

19:36.457 --> 19:37.527
Sure...

19:40.367 --> 19:42.557
This is too sudden.

19:42.557 --> 19:44.447
There you are.

19:45.207 --> 19:46.627
What's wrong?

19:46.627 --> 19:48.187
Claris!

19:48.187 --> 19:49.877
You worried about something?

19:49.877 --> 19:51.547
No.

19:51.547 --> 19:53.377
Everything's fine.

19:55.967 --> 19:58.627
It's so lonely with everyone gone.

19:58.627 --> 20:00.637
It is.

20:00.637 --> 20:03.277
I hope they come back soon.

20:03.277 --> 20:05.997
I miss them.

20:08.777 --> 20:13.077
That was hard... but I'm sure I'll...

20:13.437 --> 20:14.267
Here you go.

20:15.787 --> 20:17.007
Oh, it's you.

20:17.007 --> 20:19.217
I promised you, right?

20:20.437 --> 20:23.587
It's been more than three 
years since Ray came to us.

20:24.107 --> 20:28.907
My first impression of him was 
that he was a really quiet child.

20:28.907 --> 20:32.577
He had a calmness you wouldn't
expect from a 12-year-old.

20:33.007 --> 20:36.117
Back then, Stella was a very shy child.

20:36.117 --> 20:38.267
So she always kept a cautious eye on him.

20:39.937 --> 20:41.477
Not what you expected, right?

20:41.477 --> 20:46.027
But I suppose it must have 
been Ray's aura back then.

20:46.027 --> 20:48.537
Perhaps that's what scared her.

20:49.827 --> 20:52.697
Do you know the reason Ray 
came to live with us?

20:52.697 --> 20:57.447
Yeah. He had left the army and 
it was his master's wish.

20:57.447 --> 20:58.607
That's right.

20:58.607 --> 21:00.567
Lydia entrusted us with him.

21:01.177 --> 21:06.087
The 12-year-old boy who 
had seen hell on earth.

21:06.087 --> 21:08.457
May I ask one thing?

21:08.457 --> 21:09.337
Go ahead.

21:09.547 --> 21:11.167
Ray's master...

21:11.167 --> 21:13.587
Why did Lydia ask you?

21:13.587 --> 21:16.667
She said next to someone who had 
only known war like herself,

21:16.667 --> 21:19.377
Ray would never find happiness.

21:19.377 --> 21:22.607
She said she wanted to have him a normal,

21:22.607 --> 21:25.247
age-appropriate life,
away from all the fighting.

21:25.747 --> 21:27.547
Could I ask you to do this?

21:27.847 --> 21:32.547
You are the only ones I 
can entrust Ray with.

21:32.847 --> 21:34.017
I understand.

21:34.017 --> 21:35.477
You can leave it to me.

21:35.477 --> 21:36.407
Yes.

21:36.407 --> 21:38.617
It won't be bad to have a son.

21:39.847 --> 21:41.047
Thank you.

21:42.917 --> 21:45.997
Ray truly is loved.

21:45.997 --> 21:47.457
He's a good son, right?

21:47.457 --> 21:48.957
Very good.

21:48.957 --> 21:50.237
Here you are.

21:50.867 --> 21:52.337
Yeah.

21:52.337 --> 21:54.367
Tomorrow will be harder than today.

21:54.797 --> 21:56.767
You should go get some rest.

21:56.767 --> 21:58.257
Right.

21:58.257 --> 22:00.627
Being up late isn't good 
for your skin, Mom.

22:00.627 --> 22:02.487
Yes, thank you.

22:05.137 --> 22:06.317
Cupid!

22:08.597 --> 22:11.437
I've got much more to tell you.

22:11.767 --> 22:14.647
What? What?

22:14.647 --> 22:16.667
You're going to break 
away from your rivals.

22:16.667 --> 22:17.647
What?!

22:18.697 --> 22:21.677
I'm rooting for you.

22:28.267 --> 22:31.627
Ariane! See you tomorrow.

22:35.637 --> 22:38.427
<i>Did she say "rivals"?</i>

22:38.667 --> 22:42.417
<i>But why is my heart beating so fast?</i>

22:42.807 --> 22:46.567
<i>What is going on here?!</i>

22:46.567 --> 22:47.847
Ariane?

23:48.787 --> 23:50.477
I am Master White Black!

23:48.797 --> 23:55.377
<b>~ Next Episode Preview ~</b>

23:48.797 --> 23:55.377
<b>~ Next Episode Preview ~</b>

23:50.477 --> 23:52.107
I am Sister White Gray!

23:52.107 --> 23:53.677
I'm Ariane.

23:53.677 --> 23:55.367
This is the preview.

23:55.357 --> 23:57.187
This is the first step towards a new day!

23:56.567 --> 23:57.607
Ranger!

23:57.187 --> 23:58.887
Shine and grasp that victory!

23:58.307 --> 23:59.397
Ranger!

23:58.887 --> 24:00.607
Adversaries stand no chance!

24:00.157 --> 24:00.857
Ranger!

24:00.607 --> 24:01.077
You hear?!

24:01.077 --> 24:01.967
This is the time to rise up!

24:01.967 --> 24:02.627
Ranger!

24:02.627 --> 24:03.097
Next time on

24:03.097 --> 24:05.207
<i>The Iceblade Sorcerer
Shall Rule the World!</i>

24:05.207 --> 24:06.537
<i>Two!</i>

24:05.337 --> 24:09.217
<b>The Iceblade <b>Sorcerer
</b>Shall <b>Rule </b>the <b>World</b></b>

24:07.197 --> 24:09.227
Banding together for the third time!

24:09.217 --> 24:15.047
<b>Episode 3
The Boy Who Is the World's Strongest
Sorcerer Keeps Winning With His Team</b>

24:09.227 --> 24:11.527
"The Boy Who Is the World's 
Strongest Sorcerer...

24:11.527 --> 24:14.387
...Keeps Winning With His Team!"
